    <td valign="top" width="618"><font face="Trebuchet MS, Arial, Helvetica"> 
      </font> 
      <p align="left" class="Heading">Useful Links</p>
      <p align="left"><font face="Trebuchet MS, Arial, Helvetica">There are a 
        lot of really good links out there you may find helpful.&nbsp;&nbsp; Below 
        is a sort of &quot;compilation&quot; of some of them that the guild frequently 
        uses.&nbsp; They are broken into categories based around their most common 
        use to make things a little easier.</font></p>
      <p align="left"><font face="Trebuchet MS, Arial, Helvetica"><b>Maps:</b>&nbsp; 
        <br>
        This is the most common place we get maps from for raids.&nbsp; It's good 
        to have a copy of where we are going and it is even better to have the 
        same map as everyone else.</font></p>
      <p align="left"><font face="Trebuchet MS, Arial, Helvetica"><a href="http://www.eqatlas.com/atlas.html">EQAtlas</a></font></p>
      <p align="left"><font face="Trebuchet MS, Arial, Helvetica"><b>Quest Information:</b>&nbsp; 
        <br>
        This is probably the most comprehensive quest information on the web.</font></p>
      <p align="left"><font face="Trebuchet MS, Arial, Helvetica"><a href="http://eqdb.allakhazam.com/quest_search.html">Allakhazam's 
        Magical Realm - Quest Database</a></font></p>
      <p align="left"><font face="Trebuchet MS, Arial, Helvetica"><b>Equipment 
        Information:</b><br>
        These are probably the most up to date equipment listing and is searchable 
        as well.</font></p>
      <p align="left"><font face="Trebuchet MS, Arial, Helvetica"><a href="http://eqdb.allakhazam.com/listitem.html">Allakhazam's 
        Magical Realm - Equipment Listing<br>
        </a>EQCasters</font></p>
      <p align="left"><font face="Trebuchet MS, Arial, Helvetica"><b>Equipment 
        Prices:</b><br>
        </font><font face="Trebuchet MS, Arial, Helvetica">There are several pricing 
        locations for equipment</font></p>
      <p align="left"><font face="Trebuchet MS, Arial, Helvetica"><a href="http://www.EQPRices.com" target="_blank">EQPrices</a><br>
        <a href="http://www.MaximumEQ.com" target="_blank">MaximimEQ</a></font></p>
    </td>
